OL,3,GNEWSAFire which caused huge smoke plume
OL,4,Atreated as arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire in Wolverhampton on Saturday
OL,7,Fwhich caused a thick column of smoke
OL,8,Fthat could be seen for miles away is
OL,9,Fbeing treated as arson, police have
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FWest Midlands Fire Service sent six
OL,13,Fcrews to a property on Paget Road at
OL,14,Fabout 15:12 BST following reports of
OL,15,Fheavy smoke, prompting warnings to
OL,16,Favoid the area.
OL,18,FPolice said they were now carrying out
OL,19,Fan investigation to establish the
OL,20,Fdetails and identify those responsible,
OL,21,Fand confirmed no injuries had been
OL,22,Freported.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
